repository-code: https://github.com/fpachet/snarky
url: https://github.com/fpachet/snarky
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  A recursive symbolic inference engine inspired by BOOJUM and SNARK, with
  production rules, finite-domain propagation, explicit choice, and
  reversible search.
keywords:
  - symbolic artificial intelligence
  - inference engine
  - constraint programming
  - expert systems
